# Colang rail definitions for the EEG functional-connectivity pipeline.
#
# The input rail ("self check input") and output rail ("self check facts") are
# NeMo Guardrails library flows enabled in config.yml; their decision policies
# are the prompts in prompts.yml. This file holds the shared refusal message
# used when a rail blocks and rails exceptions are disabled.

define bot refuse to respond
  "I'm sorry, I can't respond to that."
